<title>USA: BEI Electronics Inc Q1 loss with charge.</title>
<headline>BEI Electronics Inc Q1 loss with charge.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							  Quarter ended</p>
<p>							   Dec 28,  Dec 30,</p>
<p>								1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales					     $27,081  $34,666</p>
<p> Cost of sales					  17,087   24,547</p>
<p>							     9,994   10,119</p>
<p> Selling, general and administrative expenses  9,462    7,813</p>
<p> Research, development and related expenses    1,328    1,220</p>
<p> Income (loss) from operations		     (796)    1,086</p>
<p> Interest expense					  496	647</p>
<p> Other income						200	112</p>
<p> Income (loss) before income taxes	     (1,092)	551</p>
<p> Provision (benefit) for income taxes	    (381)	198</p>
<p> Net income (loss)				     (711)	353</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share			  (0.10)     0.05</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding	     6,997    7,074</p>
<p> Dividends per common share			   0.02     0.02</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 results reflect a non-recurring charge of about $0.15 per share for various costs incurred in connection with final settlement of a dispute with the former shareholders of General Precision Industries Inc over royalties and other payments relating to the company's quartz rate sensor technology.</p>
</text>
